830441_1084964457661429_5791265303751373453_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aDdLcWkPnJcQ7kNvwHHmMgv&_nc_oc=AdqibcfW3XgvL9oqtzxyh1dD7Xep_EAs0OFAPx7avpDkAt-fnRMqM8xlU3MlymjnGsg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQEiCFkcliES6IBDO5zIrqt5so0ThoVtMoSNTPZo9CUKA&oe=6AFB18FB"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1371566178136543", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/793139181_1371566181469876_772737679900740954_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=syIMsdx8_S8Q7kNvwGhF1P0&_nc_oc=Adr-Gd24dYLMy3AyH5DBD2ymdWVrtpjqUCmXoIzGRI9O6BTuwHVoFDZcRlFr9JGhyoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTXCaXBtCJfGKoVgt5QpdVQ-1Lbfl4lc25jwAAl-mzCEw&oe=6AFB3B00"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1756098462126690", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604347072_1756098465460023_1018908953880571156_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hSK3ZESstNEQ7kNvwGusSym&_nc_oc=Adpbo7saowP6kYHx3ZiOXyh9avuQ_JchZlCyBr7NqWF6_-FhJvkTPYorzMSQIxgwb-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQyF9nHbxZztPv6-LOnLqDPutLruOm-v3YQ1RHJb7RuDw&oe=6AFB3DC8"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1633144218195167", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1633144221528500_6050571958921125258_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y_QZYxVucy0Q7kNvwHGKKrt&_nc_oc=AdrSoWVblOVkhxpljXQEnCluM70rdn3zucjBBgEMwuaXgEdN54XvnU8TgyncA7BPLsw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQlbUFovTxnNU55EeCUA61gwGw4EpzspfO67E_MEtbrbg&oe=6AFB2610"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1113974211181531", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673531334_1113974214514864_4053371199100276452_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TPgD-ZPb3swQ7kNvwEpgosl&_nc_oc=AdroCLdgd7_wje2RXgqM5x9hPU5mHibsFVye6bM8d4TWhoAETA5CWNEzwq-4FbJsvN8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_jUHQ09nODQLzvlOsXFTPo73V4gPFu_VLipQV3Qi-bQ&oe=6AFB44EB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Horror Story VR - Granny Horror Games", "keywords": ["Horror", "Scary", "Haunted", "Zombie", "granny"], "long_description": "Welcome to Horror Story VR - Granny Horror Games, a VR experience that\u2019ll keep you on the edge of your seat! You\u2019ve got one goal: escape the haunted room before the creepy inhabitants get to you. Solve puzzles, avoid terrifying creatures, and make it out alive.\n\nIn Horror Story VR - Granny Horror Games, you\u2019ll encounter some seriously spooky characters\u2014like a Zombie Dog, a dead Joker, and even an eerie Mummy. Each challenge will test your nerves and your puzzle-solving skills. The best part? You can play it alone or with a friend!\n\nThe game offers two modes:\n- Solo Mode: It\u2019s just you against the haunted room\u2014get out before it\u2019s too late!\n- Co-op Mode: Work with a friend to help each other escape. Can you both survive?\n\nKey Features:\n- Play solo or team up in co-op mode.\n- Face off against creepy creatures like Granny, Ghosts, a Zombie Dog, and more.\n- High-quality VR graphics for an immersive, hair-raising experience.\n- Puzzles that challenge your brain while keeping your heart racing.\n- Exclusively available on Oculus Quest.", "short_description": "Get ready for a spooky adventure in Horror Story VR - Granny Horror Games! You\u2019re trapped in a haunted room, and it\u2019s up to you to find a way out. Face creepy creatures like Granny, Ghosts, and even a Zombie Dog. Whether you're going solo or teaming up with a friend, every moment counts!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/futlixgames/privacy-policy/meta-oculus-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Futlix G